dvdX7-9mWAxWWEzQIHZuCDnUQ3IcHCHYoEg",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["已經來吃過很多次了，餐點算是中規中矩，但是對於口味本身比較清淡的客人，可能會覺得太鹹，希望店家可以提供讓客人自己選擇口味鹹淡的選項。雖然服務人員都有告知如果覺得太鹹太濃，可以提供清湯添加，但有時候店員在忙別的事情，造成我必須等他們服務完其他組客人才能向他們告知，然後她們又要再拿過來加，加完之後味道是OK了，但湯卻變太多喝不完，造成浪費，也造成服務人員工作量增加。加入晶旺集團會員卡，消費可以累積點數，點數可以用於兌換該店的商品，或是升級套餐，我個人是覺得還不錯，但唯一美中不足的是點數期限有點短。",null,[0,249]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18114959747820070064/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPYVdNemJHRk5NWEJ5VGpCdmQxVXhWbkJUUmxaUVVrWlNjMVpHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18114959747820070064/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPYVdNemJHRk5NWEJ5VGpCdmQxVXhWbkJUUmxaUVVrWlNjMVpHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18114959747820070064/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPYVdNemJHRk5NWEJ5VGpCdmQxVXhWbkJUUmxaUVVrWlNjMVpHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18114959747820070064/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPYVdNemJHRk5NWEJ5VGpCdmQxVXhWbkJUUmxaUVVrWlNjMVpHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18114959747820070064/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPYVdNemJHRk5NWEJ5VGpCdmQxVXhWbkJUUmxaUVVrWlNjMVpHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18114959747820070064/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhPYVdNemJHRk5NWEJ5VGpCdmQxVXhWbkJUUmxaUVVrWlNjMVpHUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1367,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOaWMzbGFNMXByTjBvd1UxVnBTRlZQUkZSc1ZGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x3c5180778eb56ee6!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlNic3laM1prN0owU1VpSFVPRFRsVFE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOaWMzbGFNMXByTjBvd1UxVnBTRlZQUkZSc1ZGRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQ